{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/3ah8rqlg","slideIndex":2,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":148.8,"width":825.6,"height":211.2},"name":"Text 3","text":"Scan column names and row samples with rules to identify sensitive fields.\nTag fields as PII_HIGH or FINANCIAL_CONFIDENTIAL and apply role policies.\nAdmin gets full values, Support partial masking, Analyst redaction or keyed hashes.\nEnforce the policy before returning results on PostgreSQL and SQLite. Keep raw data unchanged.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
