{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/z2tcnm5s","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":105.6,"width":864,"height":28.8},"name":"Text 2","text":"Challenge 1: Missed sensitive fields","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/yhkbe1o7","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":139.2,"width":825.6,"height":62.4},"name":"Text 3","text":"Problem: names alone can misclassify customer fields.\nMitigation: combine schema and sample patterns. Block uncertain fields pending review.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/l4bupwny","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":206.4,"width":864,"height":0.96},"name":"Shape 4","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#F5F5F5","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/032tgr6d","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":220.8,"width":864,"height":28.8},"name":"Text 5","text":"Challenge 2: Access bypass","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6dcr65o","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":254.4,"width":825.6,"height":62.4},"name":"Text 6","text":"Problem: a forged role or unsupported query could expose data.\nMitigation: verify roles on the server, restrict queries and deny unsupported requests.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/m5kbi1oj","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":321.6,"width":864,"height":0.96},"name":"Shape 7","geometry":"rect","fillColor":"#F5F5F5","style":{"fontSize":24,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w32dkbuh","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":48,"top":336,"width":864,"height":28.8},"name":"Text 8","text":"Challenge 3: Different database behavior","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":22,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x4vedgvm","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":67.2,"top":369.6,"width":825.6,"height":62.4},"name":"Text 9","text":"Problem: field types and query results can differ between backends.\nMitigation: use adapters and run the same role-policy tests on both databases.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#303030","alignment":"left"}}
